{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061091/block/singleImage/3252936/df/01M6422E1VF6A5Q9AVMTTAT3SE.jpg?updatedAt=1793285462\"/><figcaption>中集集團(2039)第三季純利按年升1.46倍 。</figcaption></figure><p>中集集團（02039）公布2026年首三季業績。期內，營業收入達1,268.11億元（人民幣，下同），按年升8.33%；受惠海工及清潔能源業務向好，單計第三季度純利為7.08億元，按年大增1.46倍。 集裝箱量價齊升 AIDC業務加速放量 第三季度集裝箱製造業務顯著回暖，乾貨集裝箱銷量按年及按季均大增35% 至91.65萬TEU。此外，數字能源（AIDC）業務加速放量，第三季新簽超300MW訂單，前三季累計新簽超500MW（涉資超80億元）。集團表示，將續把握高端海工裝備升級及AI算力基建帶來的機遇，穩步推進高質量可持續發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.431385+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:51:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.890191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.017622+00:00","content_hash":"a8c2a08147c8e69a020d15cac1da3fac9eee29ef4e6aa9a93eae2558dcdc234b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.431385+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}